  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 503.04 Required Throughput Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 503.04 Required Throughput Reporting.\n\n(a) The owner or operator of a gasoline storage tank having a capacity equal to or greater than 250 gallons at a gasoline dispensing facility that has not been subject to stage I requirements shall report throughput information in writing to the department within 30 days of the facility’s throughput equaling or exceeding 10,000 gallons per rolling 30-day period.\n\n(b) The written submittal required by (a), above, may be submitted on paper, via email, or via fax.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or500.html"
